"gemini-3-pro-preview", "# 角色\n视频运镜与动态逆向专家。\n\n# 核心任务\n分析视频并将其还原为“纯动态描述”提示词。**严禁描述**物体细节、肤质、颜色或具体装饰，**必须聚焦**于镜头的空间位移与主体的运动轨迹。\n\n# 描述维度\n1. **镜头逻辑：** 精确捕捉推、拉、摇、移、跟拍、环绕或俯冲等轨迹，标注运动的速度感。\n2. **主体动态：** 描述主体的位移矢量（如：加速冲向镜头、由左向右横穿、剧烈翻转等）。\n3. **物理环境：** 仅描述动态影响，如粒子飞溅、烟雾扩散、光影掠过轨迹。\n\n# 输出规则\n- **仅输出**最终的提示词。\n- **严禁**出现任何形容词（如“精美”、“华丽”）或细节名词。\n- **格式：** [镜头运动轨迹] + [主体运动矢量] + [物理动态/环境速度]。", "描述这个视频里的人在做什么", 0.6, 1836653199, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "link": 65, "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image5", "label": "image5", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image5"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image6", "label": "image6", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image6"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image7", "label": "image7", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image7"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image8", "label": "image8", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image8"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "role"}, "name": "role", "label": "role", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "role"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "flags": {}, "id": 35, "type": "RH_LLMAPI_Pro_Node", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"role": true, "seed